        "node_id": "n_5_a75c9b",
        "thought_text": "Thought-2: To fix the issue, we need to add a condition to check if the right half of the array is sorted before deciding to keep it. Additionally, we should add a condition to break out of the loop if neither half is sorted, ensuring that we always return the maximum length of a sorted subarray that can be obtained by snapping the fingers once.",
